        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="rcc-irmaa-note">Source: CMS Medicare Part B Cost Information. IRMAA surcharges also apply to Part D premiums; the amounts above reflect Part B only. Always check our <a href="/tools/medicare-irmaa-calculator/">IRMAA Calculator</a> for the complete Part B + Part D combined surcharge impact.</p>
